OL,3,ATrump's Board of Peace unveils $2.45bn
OL,4,Aplan to begin Gaza's reconstruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's Board of
OL,7,FPeace has announced a Gaza recovery
OL,8,Fplan worth $2.45bn (#1.85bn) during a
OL,9,Fmeeting on the sidelines of the UN
OL,10,FGeneral Assembly.
OL,12,FThe funding will be spread across 66
OL,13,Fprogrammes over six months, and
OL,14,Fdirected at housing, diesel generation
OL,15,Fand waste removal, among other needs.
OL,17,FBut the board admitted substantial
OL,18,Fdonations were still needed, with $18bn
OL,19,Fpledged but only $280m handed over so
OL,20,Ffar. The board estimates full recovery
OL,21,Fand reconstruction will require about
OL,22,F$71.4bn over the next decade.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
