OL,3,ATrump's Board of Peace unveils $2.45bn
OL,4,Aplan to begin Gaza's reconstruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FJared Kushner, Gaza Executive Board
OL,7,Fmember and Trump's son-in-law, conceded
OL,8,Fthe project faced "different delays on
OL,9,Fdifferent things, for whatever reason".
